## 📋 Summary of New Rules

### 1. **SnapSort Spaces Feature Organization**
- Each sub-feature in `learn_space` gets its own folder in `bloc/`, `views/`, and `widgets/`
- Example: `bloc/announcement/`, `views/announcement/`, `widgets/announcement/`
- Keeps features separate and maintainable
- Prevents file clutter in shared directories

### 2. **Model Generation Restrictions**
- **ONLY human can run migrations and generate models**
- **Agent must code as if models exist** (ignore lint errors)
- **Agent must NOT create model files or use generic classes**
- Lint errors will resolve automatically after model generation
- Agent writes migration SQL and all code, human generates Dart models

### 3. **Design System Compliance**
- **Plan files MUST instruct agents** to check design system rules first
- **Agents MUST read** `.cursor/rules/design_system.mdc` before creating UI
- **Agents MUST follow design system strictly** - no exceptions
- All UI must use design system components and patterns
- Check for existing widgets in `lib/core/widgets/` before creating new ones